'''Pokémon Adventures 20th Anniversary Illustration Book: The Art of Pokémon Adventures''' (Japanese: '''{{j|ポケットモンスターSPECIAL 山本サトシ画集: The Art of Pocket Monsters SP}}''' ''Pocket Monsters SPECIAL Satoshi Yamamoto Art Book: The Art of Pocket Monsters SP'') is an art book featuring illustrations by [[Satoshi Yamamoto]] for the [[Pokémon Adventures]] {{pkmn|manga}}. It is 172 pages long, including an index and the [[PR1|first chapter]] of the [[Pokémon Ranger the Comic: Double Mission]] {{pkmn|manga}}.

